    "<div>\n        <div>\n          <span>Phần C</span>\n          <h3>PART C: READING (2.6 pts)</h3>\n        </div>\n        <span>Điền từ &amp; Đọc hiểu</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Reading I: Cloze Passage -->\n      <div>\n        <h4>\n          I. Choose the correct word A, B, C or D for each gap to complete the following passage. (1.0 pt)\n        </h4>\n        <div>\n          There are a lot of pastimes that young people like, and one of <span>(1) ______</span> is mountain climbing. It is an active leisure activity that people can do either indoors or outdoors. If you go climbing outdoors, it is a great way to <span>(2) ______</span> your strength and enjoy nature at the same time. You can even set up your own climbing wall in your backyard or inside your home. This way you don’t have to go out and still can <span>(3) ______</span> fit and enjoy the activity.<br><br>\n          So how can you start mountain climbing? Many people take a class to learn how to climb and use their equipment <span>(4) ______</span>. Others join climbing clubs to make new friends with the same interest and go climbing together. If you are an active person and like outdoor activities, <span>(5) ______</span> don’t you try this activity?\n        </div>\n\n        <div>\n          <!-- Gap 1 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Gap 2 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Gap 3 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Gap 4 -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Gap 5 -->\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Reading II: Comprehension -->\n      <div>\n        <h4>\n          II. Read the following passage and do the task below: (1.6 pts)\n        </h4>\n\n        <!-- Bài đọc gốc -->\n        <div>\n          <p>\n            The thing I like most about living on a farm when I was small was the change of seasons: spring, summer, autumn and winter. I could see the change all come and go and each one was completely different. If I hadn't been born and raised in the country, I would have never been able to tell the difference. Now in the city, you can buy summer flowers in winter and eat the same vegetables all the year round. Whereas, in the country I could only eat things at certain times of the year. For example, strawberries in June and turnips in winter. I lived my childhood with the seasons.\n          </p>\n          <p>\n            Also we made most of our food and would never eat frozen or tinned food. Everything was fresh, so it must be better than the type of food I am taking now in the city. City people think that people in the country miss a lot of good things about modern life, but in my opinion they miss a lot more than them. They miss real life.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Task A: Multiple Choice -->\n        <div>\n          <h5>A/ Choose the best answer. (0.4 pt)</h5>\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- R_II_A1 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R_II_A2 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Task B: Answer Questions -->\n        <div>\n          <h5>B/ Answer the questions. (1.2 pts)</h5>\n          <div>\n\n            <!-- R_II_B3 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R_II_B4 -->\n            \n\n            <!-- R_II_B5 -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>",
    "<div>\n        <div>\n          <span>Phần D</span>\n          <h3>PART D: WRITING (1.4 pts)</h3>\n        </div>\n        <span>Sắp xếp câu &amp; Viết lại câu</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- I. Rearrange Box Selection (Tự động đặt dấu câu cuối câu) -->\n      <div>\n        <div>\n          <h4>\n            I. Rearrange the order of the given words to make complete sentences. (0.6 pts)\n          </h4>\n          <p>\n            👉 <strong>Hướng dẫn:</strong> Bấm chọn từng box theo đúng thứ tự để tạo thành câu hoàn chỉnh. Dấu câu cuối câu sẽ được hệ thống <strong>tự động đặt chính xác ở cuối câu</strong> (không nằm trong box). Nếu bấm nhầm, bạn có thể bấm trực tiếp vào từ đó trong vùng trả lời để hủy chọn, hoặc ấn nút <strong>\"Làm lại\"</strong>.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Rearrange Q1 -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <span>1. Sắp xếp các từ/cụm từ:</span>\n            \n          </div>\n          <p>\n            uploading / I’m / keen / not / our class forum / the photos / to / on / .\n          </p>\n\n          <!-- Answer Drop Zone -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Available Word Bank -->\n          <div>\n            <!-- Rendered via JS -->\n          </div>\n\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Rearrange Q2 -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <span>2. Sắp xếp các từ/cụm từ:</span>\n            \n          </div>\n          <p>\n            live / the people in my town / those in her city / than / happily / more / Do / ?\n          </p>\n\n          <!-- Answer Drop Zone -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Available Word Bank -->\n          <div>\n            <!-- Rendered via JS -->\n          </div>\n\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Rearrange Q3 -->\n        <div>\n          <div>\n            <span>3. Sắp xếp các từ/cụm từ:</span>\n            \n          </div>\n          <p>\n            missed / the festival / Nam and Tom / late; / arrived / they / therefore, / the important part of / .\n          </p>\n\n          <!-- Answer Drop Zone -->\n          \n\n          <!-- Available Word Bank -->\n          <div>\n            <!-- Rendered via JS -->\n          </div>\n\n          \n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div>\n        <h4>\n          II. Rewrite the following sentences using the cues given with the same meaning. (0.8 pt)\n        </h4>\n\n        <!-- Rewrite 1 -->\n        \n\n        <!-- Rewrite 2 -->\n        \n\n        <!-- Rewrite 3 -->\n        \n\n        <!-- Rewrite 4 -->\n        \n\n      </div>"
