      "transcriptHtml": "\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-200/80 pb-2\">\n              <div class=\"font-extrabold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\">\n                <span>📜 AUDIO TRANSCRIPT - TASK 1</span>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-800 bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-300\">\n                Đối chiếu lời thoại\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-sans bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/60 max-h-72 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n              <p><strong class=\"text-sky-800\">Ms Hoa:</strong> Ms Hoa said we can discuss the stress we have in our lives on the class forum. So what stress do you have?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-emerald-800\">Minh:</strong> I'm tired of trying to meet <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">my parents expectations</span> [Q1]. They want me to study well and be good at many things. So they send me to many classes like maths, English piano and karate.</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-rose-800\">Anne:</strong> Why don't you tell them <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">your interests and abilities</span> [Q2]? Minh, I talk to my parents about this so they no longer send me to classes I don't like now. I just focus on my health and try to lose some weight.</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-purple-800\">Mi:</strong> You look fit Anne, you should <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">feel good about</span> [Q4] your body.</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-rose-800\">Anne:</strong> Are you kidding me? <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">I still need to lose a few more kilos</span> [Q3: unhappy]. How about you?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-purple-800\">Mi:</strong> Me? Actually, I don't get on with <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">my sister</span> [Q5]. She is <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">jealous</span> [Q6] of anything I have and always starts arguments. So I had to talk to my mum.</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-900 italic font-medium\">\n              💡 Các phần màu vàng đánh dấu dẫn chứng câu trả lời từ Q1 đến Q6 để bạn dễ dàng so sánh.\n            </p>\n          ",
