      "transcriptHtml": "\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-200/80 pb-2\">\n              <div class=\"font-extrabold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\">\n                <span>📜 AUDIO TRANSCRIPT - TASK 2</span>\n              </div>\n              <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-800 bg-amber-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-300\">\n                Đối chiếu lời thoại\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"space-y-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed font-sans bg-white p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-200/60 max-h-72 overflow-y-auto custom-scrollbar text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n              <p><strong class=\"text-sky-800\">A:</strong> Were you sporty as a child?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">B:</strong> No, I always felt sick and weak. I had allergies too, so I always had a runny nose, and itchy skin.</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-sky-800\">A:</strong> When did that change?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">B:</strong> <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">My friends started doing sports. I wanted to, too</span> [Q1: T]. My sports instructor said ‘Do more exercise, or continue to feel sick. It’s up to you!’</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-sky-800\">A:</strong> Was it easy?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">B:</strong> No! <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">It was hard</span> [Q2: F]. I did more exercise, so my body ached. But slowly I felt better.</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-sky-800\">A:</strong> What do you do now?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">B:</strong> I do triathlons <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">around the world</span> [Q3: F - not only in VN]. It’s a tough competition. You have to <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">swim, run, and ride a bike</span> [Q4: T]. I use <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">around 6,500 calories</span> [Q5: F - not 650] in one event!</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-sky-800\">A:</strong> How do you prepare?</p>\n              <p><strong class=\"text-slate-900\">B:</strong> Three great things to do before the race are: <span class=\"bg-amber-100 font-bold text-slate-900 px-1 rounded\">eat more healthy food, sleep more, and do more exercise</span> [Q6: T]. Then you’ll be ready.</p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-amber-900 italic font-medium\">\n              💡 Các phần màu vàng trích xuất thông tin đối chiếu với các câu khẳng định Đúng (T) / Sai (F).\n            </p>\n          ",
